 codes, bundle deals, and referral","visual":"Flash countdown. Bundle deals. Affiliate code input. Referral section.","entities":["Promotion","Product"],"actions":["All Startup actions","Apply affiliate code","View bundle deals","Referral link"]},{"id":"wishlist","name":"Wishlist","purpose":"Saved products with low stock alerts and share","visual":"Collections. Low stock badge. Price drop. Share.","entities":["Wishlist","Product"],"actions":["All Startup actions","View low stock alert","Share collection"]},{"id":"notifications","name":"Notifications","purpose":"All alerts with abandoned cart recovery","visual":"All notifications. Abandoned cart reminder. Low stock. Price drop.","entities":["Notification","Order","Product"],"actions":["All Startup actions","View abandoned cart reminder","Complete purchase from notification"]},{"id":"loyalty","name":"Loyalty & Rewards","purpose":"Tiered loyalty with exclusive member perks","visual":"Tier card. Points. Perks by tier. Upgrade progress bar.","entities":["User"],"actions":["All Startup actions","View tier perks","View upgrade progress","Access member-only deals"]},{"id":"analytics_admin","name":"Admin — Sales Dashboard","purpose":"Platform sales KPIs, top products, revenue trends","visual":"Revenue chart. Top products table. Conversion funnel. Geographic breakdown.","entities":["Product","Order"],"actions":["View revenue trend","View top products","View conversion funnel","Filter by region","Export report"]},{"id":"product_management","name":"Admin — Product Management","purpose":"Full product catalogue management","visual":"Product data table. Bulk edit. Inventory levels. Publish or draft.","entities":["Product","Variant","Category"],"actions":["Add product","Edit product","Bulk price edit","Manage inventory","Publish or unpublish","Import CSV"]},{"id":"promotion_management","name":"Admin — Promotion Management","purpose":"Create and manage promotions, flash sales, and codes","visual":"Promotions list. Create form. Activ