ates as quantity changes","Instalment amount shown per month clearly on checkout — reduces friction"]}},"layout":{"iphone":{"nav":"bottom_tab_4","nav_items":["Home","Search","Wishlist","Profile"],"content":"full_width_single_column","card_style":"2col_product_grid","cta":"sticky_add_to_cart_bottom_on_product_detail","hero":"full_bleed_banner_with_shop_now","padding":"12px horizontal","image_ratio":"1:1 product cards 16:9 hero banner"},"ipad":{"nav":"top_navbar_with_cart_icon","nav_items":["Home","Categories","Wishlist","Cart","Profile"],"content":"3col_product_grid_centred","card_style":"3col_product_grid","cta":"inline_add_to_cart_on_card_hover","hero":"full_width_hero_banner","padding":"24px horizontal","image_ratio":"1:1 product cards"},"desktop":{"nav":"top_navbar_with_mega_category_menu_and_cart","nav_items":["Home","Women","Men","Sale","Cart","Profile"],"content":"4col_product_grid_max_1280px_centred","card_style":"4col_grid_quick_add_on_hover","cta":"prominent_add_to_cart_on_product_detail_sticky_right","hero":"full_width_hero_with_overlay_text_left","padding":"64px horizontal","image_ratio":"2:3 product cards portrait 21:9 hero"},"notes":"Product photography is the entire UI. Every layout decision exists to surface product images. Minimal chrome — no clutter competing with the product."},"constraints":{"avoid":["Never use a white background card border around product images — full bleed only","Never centre product titles on cards — always left-aligned","Never show more than 2 lines of product title on a card — truncate with ellipsis","Never use a dropdown for size or colour selection — always use chips or swatches","Never hide the price — it must be visible on the card without tapping","Never use a quantity stepper smaller than 44px tap target","Never show out of stock variants as available — grey them with strikethrough","Never use generic stock photography — if no product image, show a branded category placeholder","Never put more than 4 items in a bottom navigation — home, search, cart, profile is the max"],"enforce":["Add to cart CTA always sticky at bottom of product detail screen","Colour variants always shown as actual colour swatches — never dropdown","Size guide link always visible near size selector","Return policy always visible on product detail — never buried in footer","Cart item count badge always visible on cart icon","Out of stock state: grey image overlay, crossed price, ''Notify me'' CTA","Product rating and review count always shown on product detail — never hidden","Checkout progress indicator always visible — step 1 of 3, etc."]},"states":{"empty_states":[{"screen":"home","trigger":"New user, no browsing history","ui":"Featured category banners full bleed. Bestsellers grid below. Never show personalised section until 3+ products browsed."},{"screen":"cart","trigger":"Cart is empty","ui":"Shopping bag illustration. Message: ''Your cart is empty''. CTA: ''Start shopping''. Show 3 recently viewed products below if available."},{"screen":"wishlist","trigger":"No saved items","ui":"Heart illustration. Message: ''Save items you love''. Instruction: ''Tap the heart icon on any product''. CTA: ''Browse products''."},{"screen":"orders","trigger":"No orders yet","ui":"Package illustration. Message: ''No orders yet''. CTA: ''Shop now''. Never show empty table."}],"loading_states":[{"screen":"home","ui":"Hero banner loads first — skeleton full width. Below: 2-col product grid with skeleton cards — image block top, 2 text lines below."},{"screen":"product_detail","ui":"Image gallery placeholder top full width. Title and price skeleton below. Skeleton never taller than a typical product page. Variant chips skeleton visible."},{"screen":"checkout","ui":"Order summary visible immediately. Spinner on payment processing button only. Never full screen loader during checkout."}],"error_flows":[{"trigger":"Item sold out after adding to cart","ui":"Cart shows red badge on item: ''Now out of stock''. Checkout blocked until item removed. Option: ''Remove and continue'' or ''Save to wishlist''."},{"trigger":"Payment declined","ui":"Inline error below payment method. Specific reason if available: ''Insufficient funds'' / ''Card expired''. Order not placed. Cart preserved. Retry without re-entering all details."},{"trigger":"Delivery address not serviceable","ui":"Error on address step: ''We don''t deliver to this address yet''. Map shows delivery zone. Option to enter alternative address."},{"trigger":"Promo code invalid","ui":"Inline error below code input: ''Code not valid'' or ''Code expired''. Never remove the code field — let user try another. Show discount amount clearly when code is valid."}],"edge_cases":[{"case":"Single item left in stock","ui":"Urgency label on card and detail: ''Only 1 left''. Never fabricate scarcity — only show when stock count is genuinely 1."},{"case":"Product with 50+ variants","ui":"Colour selector scrollable horizontal. Size selector scrollable. Never collapse into a dropdown even with many variants."},{"case":"Guest checkout","ui":"Checkout available without account. Account creation offered after purchase — ''Save your details for next time''. Never force registration before purchase."},{"case":"Price drop on wishlist item","ui":"Push notification: ''[Product] is now [price]''. Wishlist item shows ''Price dropped'' badge with original and new price."}]},"components":["ProductCard","VariantSelector","AddToCartButton","ProductImageGallery","PriceDisplay","WishlistButton","SizeChart"],"nav_active_states":{"home":"Home","category_browse":"Search","product_detail":"Home","cart":"Cart","checkout":"Cart","order_confirmation":"Profile","orders":"Profile","wishlist":"Wishlist","profile_settings":"Profile"}}'::jsonb, 2),
  ('marketplace_core', 'Marketplace', 'Two-sided platform connecting buyers and sellers. Industry brain provides the context — what is being bought and sold. This core defines how the marketplace works.', '{}', '{"archetype_id":"marketplace_core","archetype_name":"Marketplace","description":"Two-sided platform connecting buyers and sellers. Industry brain provides the context — what is being bought and sold. This core defines how the marketplace works.","valid_industries":["Beauty & Wellness","Retail & Fashion","Food & Beverage","Healthcare","Finance","Education","Fitness & Sport","Travel & Lifestyle","Real Estate","Transport & Logistics","Events & Ticketing","Entertainment & Media","AI & Technology","Developer Tools"],"icon_pack":{"default_library":{"name":"Lucide","variant":"Rounded line","url":"https://lucide.dev"},"industry_overrides":{"Retail & Fashion":{"name":"Remix Icons","variant":"Ultra-thin line","url":"https://remixicon.com"},"Beauty & Wellness":{"name":"Phosphor Icons","variant":"Duotone","url":"https://phosphoricons.com"},"Real Estate":{"name":"Material Symbols","variant":"Outlined","url":"https://fonts.google.com/icons"},"Events & Ticketing":{"name":"Phosphor Icons","variant":"Bold filled","url":"https://phosphoricons.com"},"Education":{"name":"Phosphor Icons","variant":"Rounded","url":"https://phosphoricons.com"}},"core_nav_icons":["home","search","cart","heart","user","bell","filter","list","arrow-back","menu"],"core_domain_icons":["store","tag","star","package","share","bookmark","grid","sort","plus","check"]},"landing_page":{"sections":[{"id":"hero","generates_images":true},{"id":"how_it_works","generates_images":false},{"id":"featured_listings_preview","generates_images":true},{"id":"cta_footer","generates_images":false}],"three_js":{"style":"orbital_cards","description":"Floating product listing cards slowly orbiting a central point. Cards fade in and out. Depth layering creates parallax on mouse move.","intensity":"subtle","interaction":"mouse_parallax","avoid":"no status pills, no hero-stat-line, no ticker strips"}},"core_entities":{"entities":["User","Seller","Listing","Category","Cart","Order","Review","Message","Payment","Promotion","Wishlist","Notification","Report"],"relationships":["User can be a Buyer or a Seller (or both)","Seller owns many Listings","Listing belongs to one or more Categories","Cart belongs to User, contains Listings","Order is created from Cart, belongs to User and Seller","Review belongs to User, written about a Listing or Seller","Message belongs to a conversation between User and Seller","Payment belongs to Order","Promotion can apply to a Listing or Order","Wishlist belongs to User, contains Listings","Notification belongs to User, triggered by Order or Message events","Report belongs to User, filed against a Listing or Seller"]},"tiers":{"mvp":{"tier":"MVP","description":"Core two-sided marketplace — browse, list, buy, sell. Proves supply and demand.","screen_count":10,"primary_flows":["Browse listings → filter by category → view listing detail → add to cart → checkout → order confirmation","Seller onboard → create listing → publish → manage listings","Search → results → filter → listing detail → purchase","View order → track status → receive item → leave review"],"secondary_flows":["Save listing to wishlist","Message seller before purchase","Report a listing","View seller profile","Apply promo code at checkout"],"screens":[{"id":"home_browse","name":"Home / Browse","purpose":"Discovery — featured listings, categories, search entry","visual":"Industry brain visual type. Category chips. Featured listings grid or list.","entities":["Listing","Category","Promotion"],"actions":["Search listings","Browse categories","Tap featured listing","View promotion banner","Toggle list or grid view"],"copy":{"headline":"{{industry.copy_by_app_type[''Marketplace''].headline}}","cta":"{{industry.copy_by_app_type[''Marketplace''].cta}}","empty_state":"No listings yet — be the first to sell so