subscribers toggle. Publish.","entities":["Story","User"],"actions":["All Startup actions","Add shopping tag","Set exclusive for subscribers"]},{"id":"discover","name":"Discover / Explore","purpose":"Full discovery with brand content and sponsored categories","visual":"Personalised grid. Sponsored category. Brand content section. Topic filters.","entities":["Post","User"],"actions":["All Startup actions","Browse brand content","View sponsored category"],"copy":{"headline":"{{industry.copy_by_app_type[''Social & Community''].headline}}","cta":"Explore","empty_state":"Nothing trending yet — check back soon."}},{"id":"post_detail","name":"Post Detail","purpose":"Full post with shopping tags, tips, and brand partnership label","visual":"Post. Shopping tags overlay. Tip button. Paid partnership label.","entities":["Post","Comment","Like","User"],"actions":["All Startup actions","Tap shopping tag","Send tip","View brand partnership info"]},{"id":"create_post","name":"Create Post","purpose":"Full creation with shopping tags, paid partnership label, and scheduling","visual":"Media. Caption. Shopping tag tool. Paid partnership toggle. Schedule.","entities":["Post","User"],"actions":["All Startup actions","Add shopping tags","Add paid partnership label","Advanced scheduling"]},{"id":"messages","name":"Messages / DMs","purpose":"DMs with tip sending and subscription unlock from chat","visual":"Conversation list. Chat thread. Tip button. Subscribe CTA in chat.","entities":["Message","User"],"actions":["All Startup actions","Send tip from chat","Subscribe from chat"]},{"id":"groups","name":"Groups / Communities","purpose":"Moderated groups with paid membership option","visual":"Group header. Paid badge. Moderation tools. Posts feed. Members.","entities":["Group","Post","User"],"actions":["All Startup actions","Pay to join group","Moderate posts as admin","View moderation queue"]},{"id":"events","name":"Events","purpose":"Ticketed events with online and in-person support","visual":"Events feed. Ticket purchase option. Online event join link.","entities":["Event","User","Group"],"actions":["All Startup actions","Purchase event ticket","Join online event","View ticket in wallet"]},{"id":"creator_monetisation","name":"Creator Monetisation","purpose":"Creator enables tips, subscriptions, and brand deals","visual":"Monetisation overview. Earnings chart. Tips history. Subscriptions. Brand deals.","entities":["User"],"actions":["Enable tips","Set subscription price","View earnings","Apply for brand deals","View subscriber list"]},{"id":"subscriptions_creator","name":"Creator Subscriptions","purpose":"Fans subscribe for exclusive content from a creator","visual":"Subscription tier cards. Perks list. Subscribe CTA. Subscriber count.","entities":["User"],"actions":["View subscription tiers","Subscribe","View exclusive content","Cancel subscription"]},{"id":"brand_partnerships","name":"Brand Partnerships","purpose":"Creator applies and manages brand deal campaigns","visual":"Campaign list. Brief. Rate card. Application status. Deliverables.","entities":["User"],"actions":["Browse campaigns","View brief","Set rate card","Apply to campaign","Submit deliverable","View campaign analytics"]},{"id":"profile","name":"User Profile","purpose":"Full creator profile with subscribe, tip, and shop buttons","visual":"Avatar. Subscribe button. Tip button. Shop link. Story highlights. Posts grid.","entities":["User","Post","Follow","Story"],"actions":["All Startup actions","Subscribe to creator","Tip creator","Visit creator shop"]},{"id":"own_profile","name":"Own Profile","purpose":"Creator profile management with analytics preview","visual":"Avatar. Edit. Monetisation dashboard link. Posts. Analytics preview.","entities":["User","Post","Collection","Story"],"actions":["All Startup actions","View monetisation dashboard","View post analytics"]},{"id":"collections","name":"Collections / Saved","purpose":"Saved posts and product collections with shopping integration","visual":"Collections. Product saves tab. Shop from saved.","entities":["Collection","Post"],"actions":["All Startup actions","View product saves","Shop from saved"]},{"id":"creator_analytics","name":"Creator Analytics","purpose":"Deep analytics — reach, engagement, follower growth, earnings","visual":"Reach chart. Engagement rate. Top posts. Follower growth. Earnings.","entities":["User","Post"],"actions":["View reach","View engagement","View top posts","View follower growth","View earnings","Export report"]},{"id":"content_calendar","name":"Content Calendar","purpose":"Schedule and manage upcoming posts","visual":"Calendar view. Scheduled posts. Draft posts. Create CTA.","entities":["Post","User"],"actions":["View scheduled posts","Edit scheduled post","Move to draft","Create scheduled post"]},{"id":"moderation_admin","name":"Admin — Content Moderation","purpose":"Platform moderates flagged content and accounts","visual":"Moderation queue. Flagged content cards. Approve or remove. Appeals queue.","entities":["Post","User","Report"],"actions":["Review flagged content","Approve or remove","Ban account","View appeals","Set moderation rules"]},{"id":"admin_dashboard","name":"Admin Dashboard","purpose":"Platform KPIs — DAU, posts, engagement, revenue","visual":"DAU chart. Posts volume. Engagement rate. Revenue from creator monetisation.","entities":["User","Post"],"actions":["View DAU","View engagement","View creator revenue","View moderation stats"]},{"id":"notifications","name":"Notifications","purpose":"All activity with subscription and monetisation alerts","visual":"Activity tabs. Subscription alerts. Tip received. Brand deal updates.","entities":["Notification","User","Post"],"actions":["All Startup actions","Tip received notification","Subscription alert","Brand deal update"]},{"id":"live","name":"Live Streaming","purpose":"Live with tips, subscriber badges, and co-host support","visual":"Camera. Viewer count. Subscriber badge on comments. Tips overlay. Co-host layout.","entities":["User","Post"],"actions":["All Startup actions","Receive tips during live","Invite co-host","Subscriber-only live mode"]},{"id":"profile_settings","name":"Profile & Settings","purpose":"Full settings with monetisation, privacy, and data controls","visual":"Comprehensive settings. Monetisation section. Privacy. Data download.","entities":["User"],"actions":["All Startup actions","Monetisation settings","Privacy advanced controls","Download data","Deactivate account"]},{"id":"help_centre","name":"Help Centre","purpose":"Self-serve help for users and creators","visual":"Search. User and creator article categories. Contact CTA.","entities":["User"],"actions":["Search","Browse","Creator help section","Contact support","Appeal decision"]}],"interaction_patterns":["All MVP and Startup interaction patterns","Tip animation — hearts float from sender to creator on live","Subscriber badge on comments — crown or badge icon next to username","Sponsored post label always visible — clear disclosure","Shopping tag tap — mini product card slides up from bottom","Creator earnings chart — animates in on dashboard load","Moderation queue card — swipe right approve, swipe left remove","Brand deal status chip — applied, in review, accepted, rejected"]}},"layout":{"iphone":{"nav":"bottom_tab_5","nav_items":["Feed","Discover","Create","Notifications","Profile"],"content":"full_width_single_column_feed","card_style":"full_width_post_card","cta":"floating_create_button_or_tab","hero":"story_row_top_then_feed","padding":"0px post cards 16px inner content","image_ratio":"1:1 or 4:5 post images 1:1 avatar"},"ipad":{"nav":"sidebar_left_with_labels","nav_items":["Feed","Discover","Create","Notifications","Profile"],"content":"centred_feed_max_600px_with_sidebar_right","card_style":"full_width_post_card_in_constrained_column","cta":"prominent_create_in_sidebar","hero":"story_row_top_then_feed","padding":"16px","image_ratio":"1:1 or 4:5 post images"},"desktop":{"nav":"sidebar_left_fixed_with_labels","nav_items":["Feed","Discover","Create","Notifications","Messages","Profile"],"content":"3col_feed_centre_suggestions_right_nav_left","card_style":"constrained_post_card_max_600px","cta":"create_post_bar_top_of_feed","hero":"story_row_top_then_feed","padding":"24px feed column","image_ratio":"1:1 post images 16:9 video"},"notes":"Feed is the product. Every other screen is secondary. Create action must always be one tap away regardless of form factor."},"constraints":{"avoid":["Never paginate the feed — always infinite scroll","Never show follower count as the primary metric — show engagement rate or post count for new profiles","Never use a modal for creating a post — full-screen compose experience only","Never auto-play video with sound — always muted by default, tap to unmute","Never show ads between the first 3 posts — users haven''t engaged yet","Never collapse comments — show first 2 always, expand to see all","Never use a generic avatar placeholder — always use initials on coloured background","Never show share count if zero — only show when > 0"],"enforce":["Double-tap to like — heart animation plays on double-tap anywhere on post image","Like count updates optimistically — increment immediately on tap, sync in background","Story avatars always circular with gradient ring when unwatched","Unread notification badge on nav icon — disappears only when notification screen opened","Post timestamp always relative — ''2h ago'' not ''14:32'' — for posts under 24h","Profile always shows: avatar, username, bio, post count, follower count, following count","Report and block always accessible from post context menu — never hidden","New posts available indicator at top of feed — ''X new posts'' — tap to refresh to top"]},"states":{"empty_states":[{"screen":"feed","trigger":"New user, following no one","ui":"Suggested accounts to follow — 5-6 cards with follow button. Message: ''Follow people to see their posts''. No empty feed shown."},{"screen":"discover","trigger":"No trending content available","ui":"Category chips at top. Below: ''Popular this week'' grid populated from global trending — never truly empty."},{"screen":"notifications","trigger":"No notifications yet","ui":"Bell illustration. Message: ''No notifications yet''. Sub-message: ''When people like or comment on your posts, you''ll see it here''."},{"screen":"profile_own","trigger":"No posts yet","ui":"Grid shows camera icon placeholder in centre. Message: ''Share your first post''. CTA: ''Create post''. Post count shows 0."}],"loading_states":[{"screen":"feed","ui":"Skeleton post cards — avatar circle placeholder, name line, image block full width, action row (3 icon placeholders). Show 3 skeleton posts. Shimmer animation."},{"screen":"discover","ui":"Grid skeleton — 3-col grid of square image placeholders. Shimmer."},{"screen":"profile","ui":"Avatar skeleton circle top. Stats row 3 blocks. Grid of 9 square skeleton blocks below."}],"error_flows":[{"trigger":"Post fails to upload","ui":"Post appears in feed with red error badge: ''Failed to post''. Retry option inline. Draft preserved. Never silently drop the post."},{"trigger":"Image upload fails during compose","ui":"Failed image shows red border and retry icon in compose screen. Other images in multi-image post unaffected."},{"trigger":"Account reported and under review","ui":"Profile shows reduced visibility notice to owner only. Posts remain visible to existing followers. Clear explanation of review process."},{"trigger":"Comment violates community guidelines","ui":"Comment not posted. Inline message to author: ''This comment may violate our guidelines''. Option to edit or dismiss."}],"edge_cases":[{"case":"Post with very long caption","ui":"Truncate at 3 lines with ''more'' link. Expanding shows full caption — never navigate to new screen just to read caption."},{"case":"User blocks another user","ui":"Blocked user''s posts disappear from feed immediately. Their profile shows ''User not found''. Block is silent — blocked user not notified."},{"case":"Viral post with 10k+ likes","ui":"Show abbreviated count: ''10.2K likes''. Never show full number for counts over 10,000 — wastes space."},{"case":"Deleted post with existing comments","ui":"Comments thread shows: ''This post has been deleted''. Comments remain visible. Thread not removed."}]},"components":["PostCard","AvatarStack","FeedRow","StoryCircle","LikeButton","CommentInput","FollowButton","TrendingTag"],"nav_active_states":{"feed":"Feed","discover":"Discover","post_detail":"Feed","create_post":"Create","profile":"Profile","own_profile":"Profile","notifications":"Notifications","profile_settings":"Profile"}}'::jsonb, 4),
  ('dashboard_core', 'Dashboard SaaS', 'B2B or B2C SaaS with a data dashboard at its core. Industry brain defines the domain. This core defines how the SaaS product is structured and experienced.', '{}', '{"archetype_id":"dashboard_core","archetype_name":"Dashboard SaaS","description":"B2B or B2C SaaS with a data dashboard at its core. Industry brain defines the domain. This core defines how the SaaS product is structured and experienced.","valid_industries":["Beauty & Wellness","Retail & Fashion","Food & Beverage","Healthcare","Finance","Education","Fitness & Sport","Travel & Lifestyle","Real Estate","Transport & Logistics","Events & Ticketing","Entertainment & Media","AI & Technology","Developer Tools"],"icon_pack":{"default_library":{"name":"Material Symbols","variant":"Outlined","url":"https://fonts.google.com/icons"},"industry_overrides":{"Finance":{"name":"Material Symbols","variant":"Sharp","url":"https://fonts.google.com/icons"},"Healthcare":{"name":"Material Symbols","variant":"Rounded","url":"https://fonts.google.com/icons"},"Transport & Logistics":{"name":"Material Symbols","variant":"Sharp","url":"https://fonts.google.com/icons"},"Developer Tools":{"name":"Material Symbols","variant":"Sharp","url":"https://fonts.google.com/icons"}},"core_nav_icons":["home","bar_chart","group","description","person","notifications","settings","arrow_back","menu","refresh"],"core_domain_icons":["bar_chart","trending_up","pie_chart","table_chart","filter_list","download","upload","search","tune","more_vert"]},"landing_page":{"sections":[{"id":"hero","generates_images":false},{"id":"stats_bar","generates_images":false},{"id":"pricing","generates_images":false},{"id":"cta_footer","generates_images":false}],"three_js":{"style":"data_bars","description":"Grid of floating vertical bars animating up and down like a live chart. Gold or blue accent bars pulse brighter. Financial data energy.","intensity":"subtle","interaction":"mouse_parallax","avoid":"no status pills, no hero-stat-line, no ticker strips"}},"core_entities":{"entities":["User","Organisation","Project","Record","Report","Metric","Notification","Integration","Team","Role","AuditLog","Subscription"],"relationships":["Organisation has many Users with Roles","User belongs to Organisation with a Role (admin, member, viewer)","Project belongs to Organisation, contains Records","Record is the core data unit — its definition varies by industry (patient, property, loan, shipment, etc.)","Report is generated from Records and Metrics","Metric is a computed value from Records","Integration connects the Organisation to external services","Team is a subset of Users within an Organisation","AuditLog records all actions by Users","Subscription defines the plan and feature access for an Organisation","Notification belongs to User, triggered by system events or thresholds"]},"tiers":{"mvp":{"tier":"MVP","description":"Core SaaS — login, dashboard overview, record management, basic reporting.","screen_count":8,"primary_flows":["Sign up → create organisation → invite team → set up project → add records → view dashboard","Log in → view dashboard → browse records → view record detail → take action","View dashboard metrics → identify issue → navigate to relevant records"],"secondary_flows":["Export data as CSV","Search and filter records","Edit record","View basic report"],"screens":[{"id":"login","name":"Login","purpose":"Secure authentication","visual":"Dark or clean light. Logo. Email and password. SSO option.","entities":["User","Organisation"],"actions":["Email login","SSO login","Forgot password","Sign up"]},{"id":"onboarding","name":"Onboarding","purpose":"Organisation and project setup","visual":"Step flow. Progress bar. Form inputs. Invite team step.","entities":["User","Organisation","Project","Team"],"actions":["Set organisation name","Set up first project","Invite team members","Complete setup"]},{"id":"dashboard","name":"Dashboard / Overview","purpose":"Key metrics at a glance — the comm