e events","Search within chapters"]},{"id":"notifications","name":"Notifications","purpose":"All alerts with live event reminders and creator uploads","visual":"All notifications. Live reminder alert. Creator upload. New season.","entities":["Notification","Content","Creator"],"actions":["All Startup actions","Live event reminder","New upload from creator"]},{"id":"ratings_reviews","name":"Ratings & Reviews","purpose":"Reviews with verified viewer badge and spoiler tag","visual":"Reviews. Verified viewer badge. Spoiler toggle. Helpful votes.","entities":["Review","Content","User"],"actions":["All Startup actions","Tag review as spoiler","Filter no spoiler reviews"]},{"id":"admin_content","name":"Admin — Content Management","purpose":"Review, approve, feature, and manage all content","visual":"Content table. Status tabs — pending, approved, featured. Review queue.","entities":["Content","Creator"],"actions":["Review pending content","Approve or reject","Set featured","Remove content","Add regional restriction"]},{"id":"admin_dashboard","name":"Admin Dashboard","purpose":"Platform KPIs — active users, streams, revenue, content volume","visual":"KPI cards. DAU chart. Revenue. Top content. Creator stats.","entities":["Content","User","Subscription"],"actions":["View DAU","View revenue","View top content","View creator metrics","Export report"]},{"id":"admin_creators","name":"Admin — Creator Management","purpose":"Manage creator accounts, verification, and payouts","visual":"Creator table. Verified badge. Payout status. Content count. Suspend CTA.","entities":["Creator"],"actions":["View all creators","Verify creator","View creator analytics","Process payout","Suspend creator"]},{"id":"profile","name":"Profile","purpose":"Full profile with content preferences and watch stats","visual":"Avatar. Watch time stat. Genre preferences. Manage profiles. Settings.","entities":["User","Progress"],"actions":["All Startup actions","View total watch time","Edit genre preferences"]},{"id":"settings","name":"Settings","purpose":"Enterprise settings with data usage, accessibility, and content filters","visual":"Full settings. Accessibility. Content filters. Data usage. Regional.","entities":["User","Subscription"],"actions":["All Startup actions","Accessibility settings","Content maturity filters","Data saver controls"]},{"id":"help_centre","name":"Help Centre","purpose":"Self-serve help for viewers and creators","visual":"Search. Viewer and creator sections. Streaming quality troubleshoot.","entities":["User"],"actions":["Search","Browse","Creator help","Streaming troubleshoot","Contact support"]}],"interaction_patterns":["All MVP and Startup interaction patterns","Live badge pulses red on live content cards","Watch party sync indicator — all avatars show pause or play state","Chapter markers on player progress bar — tap to jump","Creator upload progress bar in creator studio — percentage complete","Retention curve on creator analytics — drop-off points highlighted","Spoiler review blur — blurred until user taps to reveal","Admin content queue — swipe to approve or reject","Regional restriction badge — not available in your region — on locked content"]}},"layout":{"iphone":{"nav":"bottom_tab_4","nav_items":["Home","Browse","Downloads","Profile"],"content":"full_width_horizontal_scroll_rows","card_style":"16:9_thumbnail_with_progress_bar","cta":"play_button_prominent_on_content_detail","hero":"full_bleed_featured_content_hero","padding":"0px rows 16px section titles","image_ratio":"16:9 thumbnails 2:3 portrait posters"},"ipad":{"nav":"sidebar_left_with_labels","nav_items":["Home","Browse","Downloads","Search","Profile"],"content":"grid_rows_with_featured_hero_top","card_style":"3col_thumbnail_grid","cta":"play_button_on_detail_with_resume_secondary","hero":"full_width_featured_hero_with_overlay","padding":"24px","image_ratio":"16:9 thumbnails"},"desktop":{"nav":"top_navbar_transparent_over_hero","nav_items":["Home","Browse","My List","Search","Profile"],"content":"full_width_horizontal_scroll_rows_max_1600px","card_style":"hover_to_expand_card_with_preview","cta":"large_play_button_on_hero_left_aligned","hero":"full_viewport_hero_with_gradient_overlay_text_left","padding":"64px horizontal","image_ratio":"16:9 cards 21:9 hero"},"notes":"Autoplay and continue watching are primary engagement mechanics. Progress bar on every thumbnail is non-negotiable — it is the product''s core retention signal."},"constraints":{"avoid":["Never show a content card without a thumbnail — use a branded category placeholder, never blank","Never auto-play with sound on — always muted by default in browse context","Never use a modal for content detail — navigate to dedicated content detail screen","Never show subscription prompt on first content tap — let them watch the preview first","Never use text-heavy cards — thumbnail and title only on browse grid","Never truncate content title to less than 2 lines on content detail screen","Never hide the progress bar on continue-watching cards — it is the core value signal","Never use a non-standard video player — consistent controls every time"],"enforce":["Continue watching row always appears first when user has in-progress content","Progress bar on every in-progress content thumbnail — percentage watched","Auto-play next episode countdown — 5 seconds, cancellable","Offline download available on every content item in paid tier","Content rating and duration always shown on content detail","Playback speed control always accessible in player","Resume from exact position — never start from beginning after leaving mid-content","Category/genre always shown on content card — never content without context"]},"states":{"empty_states":[{"screen":"home","trigger":"New user, no watch history","ui":"Featured content hero at top. ''Trending now'' row below. ''New releases'' row. Never show personalised sections until 3+ items watched."},{"screen":"library","trigger":"No saved or downloaded content","ui":"Bookmark illustration. Message: ''Your library is empty''. Sub: ''Save content to watch later''. CTA: ''Browse content''."},{"screen":"search","trigger":"Search returns no results","ui":"Message: ''No results for [query]''. Show trending searches. Show 2-3 browse categories below. Never just blank space."}],"loading_states":[{"screen":"home","ui":"Hero banner skeleton full width. Below: row label skeleton then horizontal scroll of 4-5 thumbnail skeletons 16:9 ratio. Multiple rows stacked."},{"screen":"player","ui":"Spinner centred on black background. Never show broken image. Buffer indicator on progress bar — different colour from watched portion."},{"screen":"content_detail","ui":"Hero thumbnail skeleton top. Title 2 lines. Meta row skeleton. Description 3 lines skeleton. Episode grid skeleton."}],"error_flows":[{"trigger":"Playback fails to start","ui":"Player shows: ''Unable to play this content''. Options: Try again, Check connection, Browse similar. Never stuck on black screen with no message."},{"trigger":"Download fails","ui":"Download item shows failed state with red icon. Retry button inline. Partial download cleaned up. Storage not consumed by failed download."},{"trigger":"Subscription required to watch","ui":"Preview plays for 30-60 seconds then pauses. Upgrade prompt overlays with: what they get, price, free trial if available. Never cut mid-sentence."},{"trigger":"Content removed from platform","ui":"Content detail shows: ''This content is no longer available''. Suggestions for similar content below. Remove from continue watching automatically."}],"edge_cases":[{"case":"Content in foreign language without subtitles","ui":"Warning shown on content detail: ''No subtitles available for [language]''. Never hide this information."},{"case":"Very long episode list (50+ episodes)","ui":"Season selector first. Episodes paginated or virtualised — never render all at once. Jump to episode input for long series."},{"case":"Simultaneous stream limit reached","ui":"Friendly message: ''You''re already watching on [X] device(s). Please stop playback there first or upgrade your plan.'' Never cryptic error code."},{"case":"Slow connection during playback","ui":"Auto quality reduction — show ''Switched to lower quality'' toast. Manual quality selector always accessible. Buffer spinner on progress bar."}]},"components":["ContentThumbnail","ProgressBar","PlayButton","CategoryRow","ContentBadge","ResumeChip","RatingBadge"],"nav_active_states":{"home":"Home","browse_category":"Browse","content_detail":"Home","player":"Home","library":"Downloads","search":"Browse","profile":"Profile","settings":"Profile"}}'::jsonb, 7),
  ('map_core', 'Map & Location-Based', 'Location-aware platform where the map is the primary interface. Industry brain defines what is being discovered or tracked on the map. This core defines how location, navigation, and proximity work.', '{}', '{"archetype_id":"map_core","archetype_name":"Map & Location-Based","description":"Location-aware platform where the map is the primary interface. Industry brain defines what is being discovered or tracked on the map. This core defines how location, navigation, and proximity work.","valid_industries":["Beauty & Wellness","Retail & Fashion","Food & Beverage","Healthcare","Finance","Education","Fitness & Sport","Travel & Lifestyle","Real Estate","Transport & Logistics","Events & Ticketing","Entertainment & Media","AI & Technology","Developer Tools"],"icon_pack":{"default_library":{"name":"Lucide","variant":"Rounded line","url":"https://lucide.dev"},"industry_overrides":{"Real Estate":{"name":"Material Symbols","variant":"Outlined","url":"https://fonts.google.com/icons"},"Transport & Logistics":{"name":"Material Symbols","variant":"Sharp","url":"https://fonts.google.com/icons"}},"core_nav_icons":["home","search","map","heart","user","bell","list","compass","arrow-back","filter"],"core_domain_icons":["map-pin","navigation","compass","route","layers","locate","zoom-in","flag","star","share-2"]},"landing_page":{"sections":[{"id":"hero","generates_images":true},{"id":"map_preview","generates_images":true},{"id":"cta_footer","generates_images":false}],"three_js":{"style":"globe_coordinates","description":"Wireframe globe rotating slowly. Coordinate grid lines. Location pin dots appear and disappear across the surface.","intensity":"medium","interaction":"mouse_rotate","avoid":"no status pills, no hero-stat-line, no ticker strips"}},"core_entities":{"entities":["User","Location","Place","Route","Pin","Review","CheckIn","Notification","Search","Category","Tracking","Address"],"relationships":["User has a current Location","Place has a Location and belongs to a Category","Pin is placed by User on the map — saved or custom","Route connects two or more Locations","Review belongs to User, written about a Place","CheckIn belongs to User at a Place","Tracking belongs to a moving entity (driver, shipment, delivery) with a live Location","Address is a resolved Location — street, city, coordinates","Search returns Places near a Location","Notification belongs to User, triggered by proximity or tracking events"]},"tiers":{"mvp":{"tier":"MVP","description":"Core map — discover places, search by location, view detail, get directions.","screen_count":8,"primary_flows":["Open app → map loads at current location → browse nearby places → tap pin → view place detail → get directions","Search location or place → results on map and list → tap result → detail → directions","Save place → view saved places → navigate to saved place"],"secondary_flows":["Share location","Report incorrect place","Filter by category","View place reviews"],"screens":[{"id":"map_home","name":"Map Home","purpose":"Primary map view — current location, nearby places, search","visual":"Full-screen map. Current location dot. Place pins. Search bar at top. Category chips.","entities":["Location","Place","Pin"],"actions":["View current location","Tap place pin","Search location","Filter by category","Zoom and pan","Toggle map style","List view toggle"],"copy":{"headline":"{{industry.copy_by_app_type[''Map & Location-Based''].headline}}","cta":"{{industry.copy_by_app_type[''Map & Location-Based''].cta}}","empty_state":"No places found in this area. Try zooming out."}},{"id":"place_detail","name":"Place Detail","purpose":"Full place information — photos, details, reviews, actions","visual":"Slides up from bottom. Place photos. Name and category. Rating. Details. Actions row.","entities":["Place","Review","Location"],"actions":["View photos","Get directions","Save place","Share place","Call place","View website","Read reviews","Report place"]},{"i