ettings. Custom name. Domain. Preview.","entities":["User"],"actions":["Upload logo","Set brand colours","Set custom product name","Configure custom domain","Preview white-label"]},{"id":"share_export","name":"Share & Export","purpose":"Enterprise sharing with access control and audit","visual":"Share link. Access control. Expiry date. View who accessed.","entities":["Conversation","Output"],"actions":["All Startup actions","Set link expiry","Restrict to org only","View link access log"]},{"id":"profile","name":"Profile","purpose":"Enterprise user profile with org context","visual":"Avatar. Name. Role. Org. Usage. Settings link.","entities":["User"],"actions":["View profile","Edit name","View org role","View usage summary"]},{"id":"settings","name":"Settings","purpose":"Full enterprise settings","visual":"Settings. Security. Integrations. Data. Privacy. SSO. White-label.","entities":["User"],"actions":["All Startup actions","SSO settings","White-label settings","Data residency","Privacy controls"]}],"interaction_patterns":["All MVP and Startup interaction patterns","Workspace switcher — org name at top of sidebar — dropdown to switch","Per-user usage bar — fills as user approaches limit — amber at 80%, red at 95%","Custom model status badge — training spinner, deployed green, archived grey","Org template approval chip — pending yellow, approved green, rejected red","API key — partially masked by default, tap to reveal with biometric confirm","Fine-tuning progress step bar — data upload, training, evaluation, deploy","Compliance mode — conversation view with user identity redacted","Budget alert banner on admin dashboard when org spend approaches limit"]}},"layout":{"iphone":{"nav":"bottom_tab_4","nav_items":["Home","History","Saved","Profile"],"content":"full_width_single_column_conversation","card_style":"message_bubble_full_width","cta":"input_bar_pinned_bottom_full_width","hero":"prompt_suggestions_then_input_bar","padding":"16px message padding","image_ratio":"no_photography_output_cards_only"},"ipad":{"nav":"sidebar_left_with_history","nav_items":["New chat","History","Saved outputs","Settings"],"content":"centred_conversation_max_720px","card_style":"message_bubble_centred_column","cta":"input_bar_bottom_centred_max_720px","hero":"welcome_message_centred_then_prompt_input","padding":"24px","image_ratio":"no_photography"},"desktop":{"nav":"sidebar_left_fixed_with_conversation_history","nav_items":["New chat","Recent conversations","Saved outputs","Model settings","Profile"],"content":"conversation_centred_max_800px_sidebar_left","card_style":"message_bubble_in_centred_column","cta":"input_bar_bottom_centred_with_model_selector","hero":"centred_welcome_with_example_prompts_then_input","padding":"32px conversation column","image_ratio":"no_photography"},"notes":"Input is the entire product. It must always be immediately visible, never scrolled off screen. Conversation history in left sidebar on desktop and iPad — always accessible without leaving current conversation."},"constraints":{"avoid":["Never show a loading spinner during AI streaming — show the text as it arrives","Never use photography or illustration in core product screens — SVG and CSS only","Never truncate AI responses — always show full output with scroll","Never use a modal for conversation history — sidebar panel only","Never auto-submit on enter without shift+enter for new line — developers expect this","Never show token count or technical API details to non-developer users","Never use a generic chat bubble for AI responses — use a distinct visual treatment","Never disable the input while AI is streaming — allow queue or interrupt"],"enforce":["Streaming output — text appears token by token, never all at once","Stop generation button always visible during streaming","Copy button appears on hover or tap of any AI message — never requires selecting text","Code blocks always syntax highlighted — language label top right","Markdown rendered in AI responses — headers, bold, lists, not raw symbols","Conversation history searchable — search by keyword, not just scroll","Usage counter visible — credits remaining or message count — before user hits limit","Model indicator always visible — user must always know what model generated the response"]},"states":{"empty_states":[{"screen":"home","trigger":"New conversation, no messages","ui":"Centred prompt area. Greeting: ''What can I help you build today?'' Below: 3-4 example prompts as clickable chips. Input bar ready and focused."},{"screen":"history","trigger":"No conversation history","ui":"Message bubble illustration. Message: ''No conversations yet''. Sub: ''Your conversations will appear here''. CTA points to new conversation."},{"screen":"saved_outputs","trigger":"No saved outputs","ui":"Bookmark illustration. Message: ''Nothing saved yet''. Instruction: ''Click the bookmark icon on any AI response to save it''."}],"loading_states":[{"screen":"conversation","ui":"User message appears immediately. AI response area shows animated dots (typing indicator) for up to 2 seconds before first token streams. Never blank space."},{"screen":"history","ui":"Skeleton conversation rows — title line, timestamp, preview line. 5 rows shimmer."},{"screen":"usage","ui":"Credit balance shows skeleton number. Chart skeleton. History table skeleton rows."}],"error_flows":[{"trigger":"API request fails","ui":"AI message area shows: ''Something went wrong. Please try again.'' Retry button inline in the message thread. Input re-enabled immediately. Conversation not lost."},{"trigger":"Credit limit reached","ui":"Soft limit warning at 80%: ''You have X credits remaining''. Hard limit: input disabled. Message: ''You''ve used all your credits''. Upgrade CTA prominent. Do not lose conversation."},{"trigger":"Content policy block","ui":"AI response: clear explanation of why it can''t help with that specific request. Suggest alternative framing. Never cryptic ''request blocked'' message."},{"trigger":"Context window exceeded","ui":"Warning before sending: ''This conversation is very long. Older context may be lost.'' Option to start new conversation or continue. User decides."}],"edge_cases":[{"case":"Very long AI response (5000+ words)","ui":"Response renders in full with scroll. Table of contents offered for structured long responses. Copy all button. Download as markdown option."},{"case":"Code in response longer than viewport","ui":"Code block scrollable horizontally. Never wrap code — horizontal scroll preserves formatting. Copy code button always visible."},{"case":"AI generates an image","ui":"Image displayed inline in conversation. Download button. Regenerate button. Prompt used shown below image. Never just a URL."},{"case":"Network drops mid-stream","ui":"Streaming stops. Partial response shown with warning: ''Response interrupted''. Retry button. Partial content preserved — not erased."}]},"components":["PromptInput","MessageBubble","OutputCard","ModelSelector","UsageRing","RegenerateButton","CopyButton","StopButton"],"nav_active_states":{"home":"Home","conversation":"Home","history":"History","saved_outputs":"Saved","usage":"Profile","settings_model":"Profile","profile":"Profile","settings":"Profile"}}'::jsonb, 9),
  ('dev_core', 'Developer Tool', 'Tool built for developers — code, APIs, CLIs, and technical workflows. Industry brain defines the development domain. This core defines how developer-first products are experienced.', '{}', '{"archetype_id":"dev_core","archetype_name":"Developer Tool","description":"Tool built for developers — code, APIs, CLIs, and technical workflows. Industry brain defines the development domain. This core defines how developer-first products are experienced.","valid_industries":["Beauty & Wellness","Retail & Fashion","Food & Beverage","Healthcare","Finance","Education","Fitness & Sport","Travel & Lifestyle","Real Estate","Transport & Logistics","Events & Ticketing","Entertainment & Media","AI & Technology","Developer Tools"],"icon_pack":{"default_library":{"name":"Tabler Icons","variant":"Sharp line","url":"https://tabler.io/icons"},"industry_overrides":{"AI & Technology":{"name":"Material Symbols","variant":"Outlined","url":"https://fonts.google.com/icons"}},"core_nav_icons":["home","code","git-branch","terminal","users","bell","settings","key","arrow-back","menu"],"core_domain_icons":["terminal","code","git-branch","key","shield","package","rocket","bug","activity","download"]},"landing_page":{"sections":[{"id":"hero","generates_images":false},{"id":"code_example","generates_images":false},{"id":"pricing","generates_images":false},{"id":"cta_footer","generates_images":false}],"three_js":{"style":"code_particles","description":"Monospace character particles falling slowly like a sparse matrix. Characters are code symbols — brackets, semicolons, operators. Dark and technical.","intensity":"subtle","interaction":"none","avoid":"no status pills, no hero-stat-line, no ticker strips"}},"core_entities":{"entities":["User","Project","Repository","File","Build","Deployment","APIKey","Log","Environment","Team","Integration","Usage","Webhook","Documentation"],"relationships":["User belongs to a Team and owns or contributes to Projects","Project contains R