es and status","visual":"Account cards — bank, credit, investment. Balance prominent. Last synced. Add account CTA.","entities":["Account","Integration"],"actions":["View all accounts","View account balance","View last sync time","Add new account","Refresh account data","View account transactions"]},{"id":"transactions","name":"Transactions","purpose":"Full transaction list with search, filter, and categorisation","visual":"Transaction list. Date, merchant, category badge, amount. Filter bar. Search.","entities":["Transaction","Account"],"actions":["View all transactions","Search transactions","Filter by account, category, date, amount","Sort by date or amount","Tap transaction for detail","Export CSV"],"copy":{"headline":"Transactions","cta":"Add account","empty_state":"No transactions yet. Connect a bank account to get started."}},{"id":"transaction_detail","name":"Transaction Detail","purpose":"Full transaction info — merchant, category, notes, split","visual":"Amount prominent. Merchant. Date. Category selector. Notes input. Similar transactions.","entities":["Transaction","Account"],"actions":["View transaction details","Edit category","Add note or tag","Split transaction","View similar transactions","Flag as unusual"]},{"id":"budgets","name":"Budgets","purpose":"Set and track spending budgets by category","visual":"Budget cards per category. Progress bar — spent vs limit. Colour coded — green, amber, red.","entities":["Budget","Transaction"],"actions":["View all budgets","Create budget","Edit budget amount","View spending vs budget","Delete budget","View transactions within budget category"]},{"id":"spending_report","name":"Spending Report","purpose":"Monthly spending breakdown by category with trends","visual":"Donut chart by category. Bar chart month over month. Category list with amounts.","entities":["Transaction","Report","Metric"],"actions":["View spending by category","Compare to previous month","Filter by account","View category detail","Export report"]},{"id":"connect_account","name":"Connect Account","purpose":"Link external financial account via open banking or manual entry","visual":"Institution search. Popular banks list. Manual entry option. Security badge.","entities":["Account","Integration"],"actions":["Search for financial institution","Connect via open banking","Manual account entry","View security information","Complete connection flow"]},{"id":"alerts","name":"Alerts & Notifications","purpose":"Financial alerts — unusual spending, budget limits, low balance","visual":"Alert list. Alert type badge. Severity colour. Mark resolved.","entities":["Alert","Transaction","Budget"],"actions":["View all alerts","View alert detail","Mark resolved","Navigate to related transaction","Manage alert settings"]},{"id":"settings","name":"Settings","purpose":"Account, security, and notification settings","visual":"Settings list. Security section prominent. Two-factor. Notification settings.","entities":["User"],"actions":["Edit profile","Two-factor authentication","Change password","Notification preferences","Data export","Log out"]}],"interaction_patterns":["Net worth counter — animates on load, counting up to current value","Budget progress bar — green below 70%, amber 70–90%, red above 90%","Transaction category badge — colour coded per category type","Pending transaction — italic or muted style — clears to normal when posted","Account sync spinner — rotates while refreshing — tick on complete","Amount always right-aligned in transaction list for easy scanning","Unusual transaction flagged with amber indicator in list","Empty accounts state — prominent connect account CTA with security reassurance"]},"startup":{"tier":"Startup","description":"Full financial platform with goals, investments, cash flow, multi-currency, and team finance.","screen_count":16,"primary_flows":["All MVP flows","Set savings goal → track progress → receive milestone notification → goal achieved","View investment portfolio → see performance → allocation breakdown → rebalance view","View cash flow forecast → identify upcoming gaps → take action","Multi-currency accounts → view in base currency → conversion rates live"],"secondary_flows":["All MVP secondary flows","Recurring transaction rules — auto-categorise","Bill tracker — upcoming payments calendar","Net worth history chart over time","Invite accountant or advisor as viewer","Tax summary export"],"screens":[{"id":"dashboard","name":"Financial Dashboard","purpose":"Comprehensive financial overview with net worth trend and cash flow","visual":"Net worth trend line. KPI cards. Cash flow summary. Goals progress row. Recent activity.","entities":["Account","Transaction","Metric","Budget","Goal"],"actions":["All MVP actions","View net worth trend","View cash flow summary","View goals progress"]},{"id":"accounts","name":"Accounts","purpose":"Full account management with multi-currency and account groups","visual":"Account groups — cash, credit, investments, crypto. Multi-currency with base conversion.","entities":["Account","Integration"],"actions":["All MVP actions","View by account group","View in base currency","View converted amounts"]},{"id":"transactions","name":"Transactions","purpose":"Full transaction management with rules and bulk edit","visual":"Transaction list. Rule indicator on auto-categorised. Bulk select. Split indicator.","entities":["Transaction","Account"],"actions":["All MVP actions","Bulk edit categories","Create categorisation rule","View rule-applied badge"],"copy":{"headline":"Transactions","cta":"Add account","empty_state":"No transactions yet. Connect a bank account to get started."}},{"id":"transaction_detail","name":"Transaction Detail","purpose":"Full detail with receipt attachment and related transactions","visual":"Amount. Details. Receipt upload. Related transactions. Category. Notes.","entities":["Transaction","Account"],"actions":["All MVP actions","Attach receipt photo","View related transactions","Mark as reimbursable"]},