ion","Never show student data to other students — isolation is absolute","Never delete a submission — only archive","Never auto-grade subjective assignments — always require instructor review","Never send bulk emails without preview and confirmation","Never use a percentage as the only grade indicator — show points earned of total alongside","Never truncate assignment instructions — full instructions always visible on submission screen","Never hide submission deadline — always prominent on assignment and student view"],"enforce":["Course publish state always visible — Draft / Published / Archived badge at top","Module drag handle always visible — left side of module row","Auto-save indicator always shown when editing course content — ''Saved X seconds ago''","Student progress percentage always calculated from completed lessons / total lessons","Assignment deadline always shown in student''s local timezone","Plagiarism warning shown if detected before grade is returned","Certificate issued notification always sent to student — never silent","Grade return notification always sent to student — never polling required"]},"states":{"empty_states":[{"screen":"instructor_home","trigger":"No courses created","ui":"Graduation cap illustration. Message: ''Create your first course''. CTA: ''New course''. Secondary: ''Import existing course''. No empty dashboard metrics."},{"screen":"course_builder","trigger":"New course, no modules added","ui":"Module area shows: ''Add your first module''. Drag hint shown. Template suggestions: ''Introduction / Core content / Conclusion'' as quick add."},{"screen":"students","trigger":"No students enrolled","ui":"People illustration. Message: ''No students enrolled yet''. Sub: ''Share your course link to get your first students''. CTA: ''Copy course link''. Bulk enroll option secondary."},{"screen":"gradebook","trigger":"No submissions yet","ui":"Gradebook table shows column headers (student name, assignments). Rows show enrolled students with 