acking_list","trigger":"List is empty","ui":"Suitcase illustration. Message: ''Your packing list is empty''. CTA: ''Add items''. Secondary: ''Use a template''. Show category suggestions: Clothes, Toiletries, Documents, Tech."}],"loading_states":[{"screen":"home","ui":"Trip cards skeleton — cover photo placeholder full width, trip name and date skeleton below. 2-3 cards shimmer."},{"screen":"day_plan","ui":"Activity timeline skeleton — time column left, activity card right. 3 activity skeletons. Map thumbnail skeleton if shown."},{"screen":"discover","ui":"Place cards grid skeleton — image top 4:3, name and category below. 6 cards shimmer."}],"error_flows":[{"trigger":"Activity details fail to load","ui":"Activity card shows name and time from local data. Details section: ''Details unavailable''. Retry button. Map pin still shows location."},{"trigger":"Group sync conflict (two users edit same day simultaneously)","ui":"Conflict banner: ''[Name] also made changes''. Show diff: their changes vs yours. Options: ''Keep mine'', ''Keep theirs'', ''See both''. Never silently overwrite."},{"trigger":"Document upload fails","ui":"Document card shows failed state with red icon. Retry button. Other documents unaffected. Local copy retained for retry."},{"trigger":"Offline during group collaboration","ui":"Changes saved locally with ''Pending sync'' indicator. Banner: ''Offline — changes will sync when connected''. No data loss."}],"edge_cases":[{"case":"Trip with only one day","ui":"Day tabs still shown — just one tab. Consistent UI regardless of trip length."},{"case":"Activity that spans midnight (late night event)","ui":"Activity appears at end of Day 1 with ''Ends next day'' label. Does not duplicate on Day 2."},{"case":"15+ person group trip","ui":"Group member list paginated. Activity voting shows top 3 voters then ''+N others''. Budget split calculator handles all members."},{"case":"Past trip (all dates in past)","ui":"Trip marked as ''Completed''. Read-only mode offer